<title>UK: BOE allots 470 mln stg in repo at unchanged 6.0%.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 470 mln stg in repo at unchanged 6.0%.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 470 million stg of assistance in repos to April 29 and May 1.</p>
<p>The Bank's repo rate was unchanged at 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>The estimated money market shortage for today is 1.25 billion stg.</p>
</text>
